          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.574,
            0.737,
            0.592
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. Choose the correct statement(s) and correct the false statement(s)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.594,
            0.774,
            0.628
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Elements are made up of molecules and compounds are made up of atoms."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.628,
            0.773,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) The molecule of a compound is always made up of two or more atoms of the same kind."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.662,
            0.73,
            0.679
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) One molecule of nitrogen gas contains three nitrogen atoms."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.679,
            0.774,
            0.713
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iv) Water is made of two hydrogen atoms, covalently bonded with one oxygen atom."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.716,
            0.676,
            0.735
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. Write the chemical formulae for the following compounds."
